; fakereal_full.def — link anchor for the fake real DLL (Win32 only).
; Carries NO export lines: F-3 proved MinGW-32 cannot express the
; decorated stdcall names via .def (see gshim.def), so all 4 fake
; exports come ONLY from __declspec(dllexport) in fakereal.c.
; Missing-one-export variants are compiled by build-harness.sh with
; -DFAKE_NO_SWAP / -DFAKE_NO_PENDING / -DFAKE_NO_SHUTDOWN (one each),
; which drop the function from the object — GetProcAddress then fails
; exactly like a real DLL lacking that symbol. fakereal_counts (the
; harness-only interrogation export) is never dropped. Variant export
; sets are byte-verified before any scenario runs.
LIBRARY glide2x_gex_real
EXPORTS
